This web version translates LiquidBottomTabs.kt, LiquidBottomTab.kt,
DampedDragAnimation.kt, InteractiveHighlight.kt, FlightIcon.kt, and the
refraction/highlight shaders in backdrop/internal/Shaders.kt into browser
JavaScript, SVG/Canvas2D, and GLSL ES 3.00. These files have been modified
for WebGL2 rendering, browser input, accessibility, and lifecycle handling.

Additional modified web components are based on LiquidButton.kt, LiquidToggle.kt,
LiquidSlider.kt, AdaptiveLuminanceGlassContent.kt, ControlCenterContent.kt,
backdrops/LayerBackdrop.kt, internal/InverseLayerScope.kt and effects/ColorFilter.kt.
Control Center actions, vertical sliders, the page gallery and resource packaging
are web additions. Original Kotlin reference snapshots are included unchanged in
the downloadable resource kit, with their local origins recorded in sources.json.

Further web adaptations include DialogContent.kt, LockScreenContent.kt, SdfShader.kt,
MagnifierContent.kt, ProgressiveBlurContent.kt, ScrollContainerContent.kt,
LazyScrollContainerContent.kt, GlassPlaygroundContent.kt, HomeContent.kt and Android
UISensor.kt. src/assets/clock_sdf.webp is copied unchanged from the original project's
app/src/commonMain/composeResources/drawable/clock_sdf.webp. It retains the original
project's Apache-2.0 attribution. Browser-native modal focus handling, keyboard gestures,
shared WebGL scroll rendering and opt-in sensor permission UI are web adaptations.

